#: admin/class-help-tabs.php:94
msgid "A last-reviewed date set in the editor, shown on the review bar."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-help-tabs.php:95
msgid "Reviewer"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-help-tabs.php:95
msgid "A separate reviewer, distinct from the author, output as reviewedBy."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-help-tabs.php:97
msgid "Aim for all four on anything in a Your Money or Your Life topic — health, legal, or financial content."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-help-tabs.php:119
msgid "Authors are the people credited on your posts. TrustBio creates a dedicated profile for each author that powers the author box, structured data schema, and E-E-A-T trust signals."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-help-tabs.php:120
msgid "Click \"Add Author\" to create a new profile. Click any author name to edit their details. The Completeness score shows how much of their profile is filled in."
