#: admin/class-help-tabs.php:128
msgid "Registered authors"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-help-tabs.php:128
msgid "are linked to a WordPress user account by email. Their profile is tied to a real login — great for your own editorial team."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-help-tabs.php:129
msgid "Guest authors"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-help-tabs.php:129
msgid "are standalone profiles with no WordPress login required — ideal for external contributors, quoted medical experts, or reviewers who don't have site access."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-help-tabs.php:130
msgid "Both types generate identical schema markup and contribute equally to E-E-A-T signals."
msgstr ""

