msgstr ""

#: admin/views/upgrade.php:156
msgid "No. Everything in TrustBio works forever, on any number of sites, with no account and no key. Nothing here is time-limited and nothing is switched off later. The features listed on this page are not in this plugin at all — they are in a separate add-on."
msgstr ""

#: admin/views/upgrade.php:159
msgid "Is Pro a replacement for this plugin?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/views/upgrade.php:160
msgid "No, it is an add-on. You keep TrustBio installed and updated from WordPress.org, and Pro installs alongside it. If you ever deactivate Pro, the free plugin and all your data carry on exactly as before."
msgstr ""

#: admin/views/upgrade.php:163
msgid "What happens to my data if I upgrade, then cancel?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/views/upgrade.php:164
msgid "Authors, credentials, categories, boxes and review bars all live in the free plugin's own tables, so they are unaffected. You lose the Pro screens, not your content."
msgstr ""

#: admin/views/upgrade.php:167
msgid "Why is Pro not on WordPress.org?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/views/upgrade.php:168
msgid "The directory hosts free plugins, and its guidelines do not allow a hosted plugin to carry locked or paid-only functionality. Keeping the paid code in a separate add-on is the arrangement the guidelines point to, and it is why this page describes Pro rather than showing you a disabled version of it."
msgstr ""

